{"book":"2-kings","lang":"en","model":"glm-5.2","timestamp":"2026-07-23T11:34:28.688643653Z","verse":10,"ref":"2-kings 2:10","tier":"glm-5.2","chapter":2,"translation":"And he said: ⟨you have⟩ made-hard ⟨the⟩ asking. If you see ⟨את⟩ me taken from ⟨את⟩ with-you, let it be so to-you; but if not, it will not be.","tokens":[{"surface":"ויאמר","gloss":"And he said"},{"surface":"הקשית","gloss":"⟨you have⟩ made-hard"},{"surface":"לשאול","gloss":"to ask"},{"surface":"אם","gloss":"if"},{"surface":"תראה","gloss":"you see"},{"surface":"אתי","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"me"},{"surface":"לקח","gloss":"taken"},{"surface":"מאתך","gloss":"from ⟨את⟩ with-you"},{"surface":"יהי","gloss":"let it be"},{"surface":"לך","gloss":"for you"},{"surface":"כן","gloss":"so"},{"surface":"ואם","gloss":"but if"},{"surface":"אין","gloss":"not"},{"surface":"לא","gloss":"not"},{"surface":"יהיה","gloss":"it shall be"}]}